{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22366","headline":"寄元九 · 白居易","name":"寄元九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨鸡才发声，夕雀俄敛翼。\n昼夜往复来，疾如出入息。\n非徒改年貌，渐觉无心力。\n自念因念君，俱爲老所逼。\n君年虽校少，顦顇谪南国。\n三年不放归，炎瘴消颜色。\n山无杀草霜，水有含沙蜮。\n健否远不知，书多隔年得。\n愿君少愁苦，我亦加餐食。\n各保金石躯，以慰长相忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}